{"type":"message","id":"00668d9d","parentId":"c8e909a7","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:48:18.555Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The service is returning \"Unauthorized\" for GET / and \"error code: 1101\" for POST /send. The 1101 error code from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker rejected\" - likely the API key format or the send endpoint has specific requirements.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the POST body needs to be formatted differently, or maybe the API expects something other than JSON.\n","thinkingSignature":"d6cc6facc74385121a6439769e0e2924a4dc37c504ccf691fc02ab3af18ba1ef"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_688ebf521a054a15ab93e4ab","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d \"content=Heartbeat+08:45+UTC&threadId=arbitration\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":503,"output":178,"cacheRead":23488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24169,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780476494181,"responseId":"066f1d4e6a65b6c4f4b0b8adf448d392"}}
