{"type":"message","id":"6eb9fefd","parentId":"ab96039a","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:48:27.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare error 1101 is \"Worker thrown exception\" - meaning the Worker itself is crashing or throwing an error. The issue might be with the request format or the Worker code has a bug. Let me try with a simpler request to debug.\n\nActually, the issue seems to be on the server side (Cloudflare Worker error). The GET /history works fine but POST /send fails with a 1101. This could mean:\n1. The Worker has a bug in the /send endpoint\n2. The request body format is wrong\n3. The Worker is running out of resources\n\nSince the GET endpoint works but POST doesn't, and the error is a Cloudflare Worker error (1101), this is likely a server-side issue with the Worker implementation rather than an auth issue. \n\nThe Worker is throwing an exception when handling the POST request, but since the user specifically asked me to use POST /send, I should let them know about this server-side issue rather than giving up.\n","thinkingSignature":"b9ae6f84166f74b9abc1882cd0247d051bc5ce59c28545667d238b6e7c5aca08"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告** (08:45 UTC)\n\n## 📊 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 正常 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 正常 |\n\n- 双线程均**无新增人类讨论**，无需互动响应\n- 最新消息约9小时前\n\n## ⚠️ 发送失败\n\n**问题**：`POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare Worker Error `1101`（Worker抛出异常）\n\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n**分析**：\n- `GET /history` ✅ 正常（认证通过，数据返回）\n- `POST /send` ❌ 服务器错误（非401认证失败，而是500类服务器异常）\n- 可能是 Worker 端 `/send` 路由实现有bug或资源限制\n\n## 建议\n联系 ECHO Platform 管理员检查 Worker 日志，修复 `/send` 端点的异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":171,"output":418,"cacheRead":23936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24525,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780476498782,"responseId":"066f1d53d257093b041472d11f658e02"}}
